        "x1": 0.5051633802816902,
        "y1": 0.5862068965517242
      },
      "text": "constreyned undir the claues and nayles of the hauke, is as halfe deed for drede. Caxton's Divers Fruyt/iil Ghostly Maters.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
