        "y0": 0.7189655172413794,
        "x1": 0.952112676056338,
        "y1": 0.7586206896551724
      },
      "text": "Long lay the kyng,there away wolde not hee Dayly he propherld batayle : the enmys durst not fyghte Lacke of logynge and vltayle It was grett peté,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09201971830985915,
        "y0": 0.7224896551724138,
        "x1": 0.5051633802816902,
        "y1": 0.7856327586206897
      },
      "text": "the fleet, returned to the king, and told him there waa nothing ready ; and that the mariners and souldiers would not yeeld to goe the voyage till they were paid their arrears. MS. HarU 383.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
