        "y0": 0.7781603448275862,
        "x1": 0.931456338028169,
        "y1": 0.795401724137931
      },
      "text": "Lowe, how the good Lorde hls owne gentill kuyzle,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06948450704225352,
        "y0": 0.7844827586206897,
        "x1": 0.379343661971831,
        "y1": 0.80115
      },
      "text": "PERVEY To provide. (A-N)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183098591549296,
        "y0": 0.7908051724137931,
        "x1": 0.9408450704225352,
        "y1": 0.8303637931034483
      },
      "text": "Because he shulde rememblr hym In wele and In woo, Thus in every thyng, Lorde, thy wIlle be doo Reg",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06948450704225352,
        "y0": 0.7965517241379311,
        "x1": 0.48638591549295773,
        "y1": 0.8149431034482759
      },
      "text": "PERVINKE. The herb periwinkle. (A-s)",
